On evClick,evMouseDown,evMouseUp ## Workaround: the evClick- event is swallowed if a method editor is front, so use mouse events (Studio 10.22)
	# Process event and continue ## Problems with correct view, calculate cView by hand.
	If cView<>0
		Calculate cView as 0
		Do $cinst.$applyView()
		Do $cinst.$redraw()
		
		# show cursor in script and select all
		Queue set current field efScript
		Queue keyboard event com-A
	End If